---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Colophon"
  description="What an agent produced, what the supervisor verified, and how this static site is built."
  ogImage="/og/home.png"
>
  <article class="prose-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="kicker">Colophon</p>
      <h1>Who made this, and what was checked.</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="prose-body">
      <p class="colophon-line">
        An agent (Claude Code 2.1.308, deepseek-v4.1-flash) wrote every file
        under <code>src/</code>, <code>scripts/</code> and
        <code>public/assets/</code>; the supervisor wrote the positioning
        sentence, the task card and its definition of done, the asset-manifest
        rules, <code>CLAUDE.md</code> and <code>docs/INVARIANTS.md</code>, and
        verified <code>npm run verify</code> and the three case-study failure
        modes by hand.
      </p>
      <p>
        The full account is in the <a href="/docs/BUILD-LOG.md">build log</a>
        (<code>docs/BUILD-LOG.md</code>).
      </p>

      <section class="colophon-section" aria-labelledby="colophon-build">
        <h2 id="colophon-build">Build</h2>
        <dl class="colophon-list">
          <div>
            <dt>Framework</dt>
            <dd>Astro 5, static output, no adapters</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Styles</dt>
            <dd>Tailwind v4 through @tailwindcss/vite, plus one global stylesheet</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Content</dt>
            <dd>Three committed case-study snapshots, validated at build time</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Social images</dt>
            <dd>4 PNG files rendered at build time with satori and @resvg/resvg-js from system fonts</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Resume</dt>
            <dd>1 PDF generated from src/data/resume.json with pdf-lib, no headless browser</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Client JS</dt>
            <dd>0 KB; the site ships no scripts and no tracking</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <section class="colophon-section" aria-labelledby="colophon-verify">
        <h2 id="colophon-verify">Verification</h2>
        <p>
          <code>npm run verify</code> runs Astro's type check, <code>tsc
          --noEmit</code>, the asset and content contracts, the copy audit, the
          static accessibility audit, the JavaScript budget and the build. A
          failing check exits non-zero.
        </p>
        <p>
          Lighthouse and axe have not been run in this environment because no
          browser is available. <code>README.md</code> records the exact
          commands a reviewer can run.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
